        "design_plan": false
      },
      "time": "~30s",
      "narrative": "- One of my favorite features of the GitHub Copilot app is that I can hand my work directly into my preferred editor.\n- With a single click, I can open the entire project in Visual Studio Code and continue building without losing any context.",
      "demo_actions": "Show the handoff from GitHub Copilot into Visual Studio Code. Open the full project and briefly orient the viewer to the editor with the inherited project context.",
      "screenshot": ".cutready/screenshots/20260622_142540_vlcsnap-2026-06-22-14h25m35s396.png"
    },
